Zero build, zero dependencies, zero external requests — so what's committed is exactly what's served. All content traces to `info.md`, which is unchanged. The two publication titles that differ from the CV do so only by hyphen codepoint (U+2010 in the CV vs `-` on the page); wording is identical.

